Subject: [PATCH 5/5] fill adaptive-cpa: read foreign definitions only through
 readers (seal fixes)

simulate_pure instead of rfl in simulate_tapeImpl_congr; the outLens cast read in the
right direction; acHandler_finish stated at the handler's output width; the composite's
final return read through simulate_pure and expect_pure.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PqpVTm8SAfk12DMX1esC2g
